/ble/                           @opsthomaz
/parser/                        @opsthomaz
/research/                      @opsthomaz
/docs/ARCHITECTURE.md           @opsthomaz
/docs/RESEARCH.md               @opsthomaz
/CLAUDE.md                      @opsthomaz

# ── Architectural contracts: changing reshapes the import graph ──
/.importlinter                  @opsthomaz

# ── CI / supply-chain: changes here affect what gets built and shipped ──
/.github/                       @opsthomaz
/packaging/                     @opsthomaz
